2 CONC idn't and that every time somebody called Thomas was out.    The English part of the document reads:    June ye 18th 1722  Thomas Spark was not at home I showed his wife ye precis and left ye English note with her ... John Chapman.    .... Thomas'
2 CONC s wife would be Alice (nee Gill)
