1 _DSCR http://www.calverley.info/fars_rehob.htm
2 CONT The Baptist Chapel at Farsley was built in 1777 at Bagley. The church was formed on 27th March 1780. Their first minister was William Roe. The new chapel was built in 1869 on Calverley Lane.
2 CONT 
2 CONT The new chapel is now demolished while the Bagley Chapel is used for business premises.
